Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They got the music box on their wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom never let me touch it, but Dad didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever Mom was out, I was allowed to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I could play with it for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched the little wheel spin round and round and round.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day Mom came home early,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,got furious with Dad and yelled at him all evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He said nothing; he just went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I was alone with her.
